### Configuration Updates

#### [MODIFY] [config.yaml](file:///c:/Users/user/OneDrive/Documents/App-Web%20Dev/trx/config/config.yaml)

Add news filter configuration section:

```yaml
news:
  enabled: true
  calendar_path: "data/economic_calendar.csv"
  block_before_minutes: 45
  block_after_minutes: 30
  high_impact_only: true
  sentiment_threshold: -0.5  # Skip trade if sentiment opposes direction below this
```

#### [MODIFY] [config.py](file:///c:/Users/user/OneDrive/Documents/App-Web%20Dev/trx/src/v1_0/core/config.py)

Add `NewsConfig` dataclass and integrate into main [Config](file:///c:/Users/user/OneDrive/Documents/App-Web%20Dev/trx/src/v1_0/core/strategy.py#33-38) class.

